#: ../../library/ssl.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`ssl` --- SSL/TLS module"
msgstr ":mod:`ssl` --- SSL/TLS modul"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module provides access to Transport Layer Security (previously and "
"widely known as “Secure Sockets Layer”) encryption and peer authentication "
"facilities for network sockets, both client-side and server-side."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul omogućuje pristup mehanizmima za šifriranje i provjeru identiteta"
" na razini Transport Layer Security (ranije i šire poznato kao “Secure "
"Sockets Layer”) za mrežne socket-e, kako na strani klijenta tako i na strani"
" poslužitelja."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:13
msgid ""
"**New to TLS on the camera?** Start with the :ref:`tls_certificates` "
"tutorial. It walks through choosing key types, creating and converting "
"certificates to the DER format the camera requires, getting them onto the "
"device, and verifying servers and clients -- with complete working examples."
msgstr ""
"**Nov si u radu s TLS-om na kameri?** Započni s vodičem "
":ref:`tls_certificates`\\ . On vodi kroz odabir vrsta ključeva, stvaranje i "
"pretvaranje certifikata u DER format koji kamera zahtijeva, prijenos na "
"uređaj te provjeru poslužitelja i klijenata -- s potpunim radnim primjerima."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:21
msgid ""
"MicroPython does not implement ``ssl.SSLError``. SSL/TLS failures are raised"
" as ``OSError`` instead."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython ne implementira ``ssl.SSLError``\\ . Pogreške SSL/TLS-a umjesto "
"toga se dižu kao ``OSError``\\ ."

