#: ../../library/ssl.rst:78
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:82
msgid ""
"Wrap the given *sock* and return a new wrapped-socket object.  The "
"implementation of this function is to first create an :class:`SSLContext` "
"and then call the :meth:`SSLContext.wrap_socket` method on that context "
"object.  The arguments *sock*, *server_side* and *server_hostname* are "
"passed through unchanged to the method call.  The argument *do_handshake* is"
" passed through as *do_handshake_on_connect*.  The remaining arguments have "
"the following behaviour:"
msgstr ""
"Omata zadani *sock* i vraća novi omotani socket objekt.  Implementacija ove "
"funkcije najprije stvara :class:`SSLContext`\\ , a zatim na tom kontekstnom "
"objektu poziva metodu :meth:`SSLContext.wrap_socket`\\ .  Argumenti *sock*\\"
" , *server_side* i *server_hostname* nepromijenjeni se prosljeđuju u poziv "
"metode.  Argument *do_handshake* prosljeđuje se kao "
"*do_handshake_on_connect*\\ .  Preostali argumenti imaju sljedeće ponašanje:"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:88
msgid ""
"*cert_reqs* determines whether the peer (server or client) must present a "
"valid certificate. Note that ``ssl.CERT_NONE`` and ``ssl.CERT_OPTIONAL`` do "
"not validate any certificate; only ``ssl.CERT_REQUIRED`` does."
msgstr ""
"*cert_reqs* određuje mora li druga strana (poslužitelj ili klijent) "
"predočiti valjani certifikat. Imajte na umu da ``ssl.CERT_NONE`` i "
"``ssl.CERT_OPTIONAL`` ne provjeravaju nijedan certifikat; to čini samo "
"``ssl.CERT_REQUIRED``\\ ."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:92
msgid ""
"*cadata* is a bytes object containing the CA certificate chain (in DER "
"format) that will validate the peer's certificate.  Currently only a single "
"DER-encoded certificate is supported."
msgstr ""
"*cadata* je bytes objekt koji sadrži lanac CA certifikata (u DER formatu) "
"koji će provjeriti certifikat druge strane.  Trenutačno je podržan samo "
"jedan DER-kodirani certifikat."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:96
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klase"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:100
msgid ""
"Create a new SSLContext instance.  The *protocol* argument must be one of "
"the ``PROTOCOL_*`` constants."
msgstr ""
"Stvara novu instancu SSLContext.  Argument *protocol* mora biti jedna od "
"konstanti ``PROTOCOL_*``\\ ."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:105
msgid ""
"Load a private key and the corresponding certificate.  The *certfile* is a "
"string with the file path of the certificate.  The *keyfile* is a string "
"with the file path of the private key."
msgstr ""
"Učitava privatni ključ i odgovarajući certifikat.  *certfile* je niz znakova"
" s putanjom datoteke certifikata.  *keyfile* je niz znakova s putanjom "
"datoteke privatnog ključa."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:109 ../../library/ssl.rst:184
msgid "Difference to CPython"
msgstr "Razlika u odnosu na CPython"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:112
msgid ""
"MicroPython extension: *certfile* and *keyfile* can be bytes objects instead"
" of strings, in which case they are interpreted as the actual "
"certificate/key data."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython proširenje: *certfile* i *keyfile* mogu biti bytes objekti "
"umjesto nizova znakova, u kojem se slučaju tumače kao stvarni podaci "
"certifikata/ključa."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:117
msgid ""
"Load the CA certificate chain that will validate the peer's certificate. "
"*cafile* is the file path of the CA certificates.  *cadata* is a bytes "
"object containing the CA certificates.  Only one of these arguments should "
"be provided."
msgstr ""
"Učitava lanac CA certifikata koji će provjeriti certifikat druge strane. "
"*cafile* je putanja datoteke CA certifikata.  *cadata* je bytes objekt koji "
"sadrži CA certifikate.  Treba navesti samo jedan od ovih argumenata."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:123
msgid "Get a list of enabled ciphers, returned as a list of strings."
msgstr "Dohvaća popis omogućenih šifri, vraćen kao popis nizova znakova."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:127
msgid ""
"Set the available ciphers for sockets created with this context.  *ciphers* "
"should be a list of strings in the `IANA cipher suite format "
"<https://wiki.mozilla.org/Security/Cipher_Suites>`_ ."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja dostupne šifre za socket-e stvorene s ovim kontekstom.  *ciphers* "
"treba biti popis nizova znakova u `IANA formatu šifrarnih kompleta "
"<https://wiki.mozilla.org/Security/Cipher_Suites>`_ ."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:132
msgid ""
"Takes a :std:term:`stream` *sock* (usually socket.socket instance of "
"``SOCK_STREAM`` type), and returns an instance of ssl.SSLSocket, wrapping "
"the underlying stream. The returned object has the usual :std:term:`stream` "
"interface methods like ``read()``, ``write()``, etc."
msgstr ""
"Prima :std:term:`stream` *sock* (obično instancu socket.socket tipa "
"``SOCK_STREAM``\\ ) i vraća instancu ssl.SSLSocket koja omata temeljni tok. "
"Vraćeni objekt ima uobičajene metode sučelja :std:term:`stream` poput "
"``read()``\\ , ``write()`` itd."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:137
msgid ""
"*server_side* selects whether the wrapped socket is on the server or client "
"side. A server-side SSL socket should be created from a normal socket "
"returned from :meth:`~socket.socket.accept()` on a non-SSL listening server "
"socket."
msgstr ""
"*server_side* odabire je li omotani socket na strani poslužitelja ili "
"klijenta. SSL socket na strani poslužitelja treba stvoriti iz normalnog "
"socket-a vraćenog iz :meth:`~socket.socket.accept()` na ne-SSL slušajućem "
"poslužiteljskom socket-u."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:141
msgid ""
"*do_handshake_on_connect* determines whether the handshake is done as part "
"of the ``wrap_socket`` or whether it is deferred to be done as part of the "
"initial reads or writes For blocking sockets doing the handshake immediately"
" is standard. For non-blocking sockets (i.e. when the *sock* passed into "
"``wrap_socket`` is in non-blocking mode) the handshake should generally be "
"deferred because otherwise ``wrap_socket`` blocks until it completes."
msgstr ""
"*do_handshake_on_connect* određuje izvodi li se rukovanje (handshake) kao "
"dio ``wrap_socket`` ili se odgađa kako bi se izvelo u sklopu početnog "
"čitanja ili pisanja. Za blokirajuće socket-e standardno je rukovanje izvesti"
" odmah. Za neblokirajuće socket-e (tj. kada je *sock* proslijeđen u "
"``wrap_socket`` u neblokirajućem načinu rada) rukovanje treba općenito "
"odgoditi jer u protivnom ``wrap_socket`` blokira dok se ne dovrši."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:148
msgid ""
"*server_hostname* is for use as a client, and sets the hostname to check "
"against the received server certificate.  It also sets the name for Server "
"Name Indication (SNI), allowing the server to present the proper "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"*server_hostname* služi za uporabu kao klijent i postavlja ime poslužitelja "
"koje se provjerava u odnosu na primljeni certifikat poslužitelja.  Također "
"postavlja ime za Server Name Indication (SNI), omogućujući poslužitelju da "
"predoči ispravan certifikat."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:152
msgid ""
"*client_id* is a MicroPython-specific extension argument used only when "
"implementing a DTLS Server. See :ref:`dtls` for details."
msgstr ""
"*client_id* je argument proširenja specifičan za MicroPython koji se koristi"
" samo pri implementaciji DTLS poslužitelja. Pojedinosti potražite u "
":ref:`dtls`\\ ."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:157
msgid ""
"By default no certificate validation is performed (:data:`ssl.CERT_NONE`). "
"For a secure connection you must verify the peer's certificate by setting "
"*cert_reqs* / :attr:`SSLContext.verify_mode` to :data:`ssl.CERT_REQUIRED`; "
"otherwise the connection is vulnerable to man-in-the-middle attacks."
msgstr ""
"Prema zadanim postavkama ne provodi se provjera certifikata (\\ "
":data:`ssl.CERT_NONE`\\ ). Za sigurnu vezu morate provjeriti certifikat "
"druge strane postavljanjem *cert_reqs* / :attr:`SSLContext.verify_mode` na "
":data:`ssl.CERT_REQUIRED`\\ ; u protivnom je veza ranjiva na napade tipa "
"man-in-the-middle."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:163
msgid ""
"CPython's ``wrap_socket`` returns an ``SSLSocket`` object which has methods "
"typical for sockets, such as ``send``, ``recv``, etc. MicroPython's "
"``wrap_socket`` returns an object more similar to CPython's ``SSLObject`` "
"which does not have these socket methods."
msgstr ""
"CPython-ov ``wrap_socket`` vraća objekt ``SSLSocket`` koji ima metode "
"tipične za socket-e, kao što su ``send``\\ , ``recv`` itd. MicroPython-ov "
"``wrap_socket`` vraća objekt sličniji CPython-ovom ``SSLObject`` koji nema "
"te socket metode."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:170
msgid ""
"Set or get the behaviour for verification of peer certificates.  Must be one"
" of the ``CERT_*`` constants."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja ili dohvaća ponašanje za provjeru certifikata druge strane.  Mora "
"biti jedna od konstanti ``CERT_*``\\ ."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:175
msgid ""
"``ssl.CERT_REQUIRED`` requires the device's date/time to be properly set, "
"e.g. using `mpremote rtc --set <mpremote_command_rtc>` or ``ntptime``, and "
"``server_hostname`` must be specified when on the client side."
msgstr ""
"``ssl.CERT_REQUIRED`` zahtijeva da su datum/vrijeme uređaja ispravno "
"postavljeni, npr. pomoću `mpremote rtc --set <mpremote_command_rtc>` ili "
"``ntptime``\\ , a ``server_hostname`` mora biti naveden kada se radi na "
"strani klijenta."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:182
msgid "DTLS support"
msgstr "Podrška za DTLS"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:187
msgid "This is a MicroPython extension."
msgstr "Ovo je MicroPython proširenje."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:189
msgid ""
"This module supports DTLS in client and server mode via the "
":data:`PROTOCOL_DTLS_CLIENT` and :data:`PROTOCOL_DTLS_SERVER` constants that"
" can be used as the ``protocol`` argument of :class:`SSLContext`."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul podržava DTLS u klijentskom i poslužiteljskom načinu rada putem "
"konstanti :data:`PROTOCOL_DTLS_CLIENT` i :data:`PROTOCOL_DTLS_SERVER` koje "
"se mogu upotrijebiti kao argument ``protocol`` u :class:`SSLContext`\\ ."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:193
msgid ""
"In this case the underlying socket is expected to behave as a datagram "
"socket (i.e. like the socket opened with ``socket.socket`` with "
"``socket.AF_INET`` as ``af`` and ``socket.SOCK_DGRAM`` as ``type``)."
msgstr ""
"U tom se slučaju očekuje da se temeljni socket ponaša kao datagramski socket"
" (tj. poput socket-a otvorenog s ``socket.socket`` uz ``socket.AF_INET`` kao"
" ``af`` i ``socket.SOCK_DGRAM`` kao ``type``\\ )."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:198
msgid "DTLS server support"
msgstr "Podrška za DTLS poslužitelj"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:200
msgid ""
"MicroPython's DTLS server support is configured with \"Hello Verify\" as "
"required for DTLS 1.2. This is transparent for DTLS clients, but there are "
"relevant considerations when implementing a DTLS server in MicroPython:"
msgstr ""
"MicroPython-ova podrška za DTLS poslužitelj konfigurirana je s \"Hello "
"Verify\" kako to zahtijeva DTLS 1.2. To je prozirno za DTLS klijente, ali "
"postoje važna razmatranja pri implementaciji DTLS poslužitelja u "
"MicroPython-u:"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:204
msgid ""
"The server should pass an additional argument *client_id* when calling "
":meth:`SSLContext.wrap_socket()`. This ID must be a `bytes` object (or "
"similar) with a transport-specific identifier representing the client."
msgstr ""
"Poslužitelj treba proslijediti dodatni argument *client_id* pri pozivu "
":meth:`SSLContext.wrap_socket()`\\ . Taj ID mora biti `bytes` objekt (ili "
"sličan) s identifikatorom specifičnim za prijenos koji predstavlja klijenta."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:208
msgid ""
"The simplest approach is to convert the tuple of ``(client_ip, "
"client_port)`` returned from ``socket.recv_from()`` into a byte string, "
"i.e.::"
msgstr ""
"Najjednostavniji je pristup pretvoriti torku ``(client_ip, client_port)`` "
"koju vraća ``socket.recv_from()`` u niz bajtova, tj.::"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:216
msgid ""
"The first time a client connects, the server call to ``wrap_socket`` will "
"fail with a :exc:`OSError` error \"Hello Verify Required\". This is because "
"the DTLS \"Hello Verify\" cookie is not yet known by the client. If the same"
" client connects a second time then ``wrap_socket`` will succeed."
msgstr ""
"Prvi put kada se klijent poveže, poslužiteljev poziv funkciji "
"``wrap_socket`` neuspjet će s pogreškom :exc:`OSError` \"Hello Verify "
"Required\". To je zato što DTLS \"Hello Verify\" kolačić klijentu još nije "
"poznat. Ako se isti klijent poveže drugi put, ``wrap_socket`` će uspjeti."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:221
msgid ""
"DTLS cookies for \"Hello Verify\" are associated with the "
":class:`SSLContext` object, so the same :class:`SSLContext` object should be"
" used to wrap a subsequent connection from the same client. The cookie "
"implementation includes a timeout and has constant memory use regardless of "
"how many clients connect, so it's OK to reuse the same :class:`SSLContext` "
"object for the lifetime of the server."
msgstr ""
"DTLS kolačići za \"Hello Verify\" povezani su s objektom "
":class:`SSLContext`\\ , pa za omatanje sljedeće veze od istog klijenta treba"
" upotrijebiti isti objekt :class:`SSLContext`\\ . Implementacija kolačića "
"uključuje istek vremena i ima konstantnu uporabu memorije bez obzira na to "
"koliko se klijenata poveže, pa je u redu ponovno koristiti isti objekt "
":class:`SSLContext` tijekom cijelog životnog vijeka poslužitelja."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:228
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstante"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:233
msgid ""
"Supported value for the *protocol* parameter, selecting TLS client mode."
msgstr ""
"Podržana vrijednost za parametar *protocol*\\ , koja odabire TLS klijentski "
"način rada."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:238
msgid ""
"Supported value for the *protocol* parameter, selecting TLS server mode."
msgstr ""
"Podržana vrijednost za parametar *protocol*\\ , koja odabire TLS "
"poslužiteljski način rada."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:243
msgid ""
"Supported value for the *protocol* parameter, selecting DTLS client mode."
msgstr ""
"Podržana vrijednost za parametar *protocol*\\ , koja odabire DTLS klijentski"
" način rada."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:248
msgid ""
"Supported value for the *protocol* parameter, selecting DTLS server mode."
msgstr ""
"Podržana vrijednost za parametar *protocol*\\ , koja odabire DTLS "
"poslužiteljski način rada."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:253
msgid ""
"Supported value for the *cert_reqs* parameter, and the "
":attr:`SSLContext.verify_mode` attribute.  No certificate verification is "
"performed on the peer."
msgstr ""
"Podržana vrijednost za parametar *cert_reqs* i atribut "
":attr:`SSLContext.verify_mode`\\ .  Ne provodi se provjera certifikata druge"
" strane."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:260
msgid ""
"Supported value for the *cert_reqs* parameter, and the "
":attr:`SSLContext.verify_mode` attribute.  Certificate verification is "
"optional.  Note that on the OpenMV Cam this behaves like "
":data:`ssl.CERT_NONE`."
msgstr ""
"Podržana vrijednost za parametar *cert_reqs* i atribut "
":attr:`SSLContext.verify_mode`\\ .  Provjera certifikata je neobavezna.  "
"Imajte na umu da se na OpenMV Cam ovo ponaša kao :data:`ssl.CERT_NONE`\\ ."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:268
msgid ""
"Supported value for the *cert_reqs* parameter, and the "
":attr:`SSLContext.verify_mode` attribute.  A valid certificate is required "
"from the peer."
msgstr ""
"Podržana vrijednost za parametar *cert_reqs* i atribut "
":attr:`SSLContext.verify_mode`\\ .  Od druge strane zahtijeva se valjani "
"certifikat."
